# Companion knowledge base: answers read only library/index (chunks.jsonl, sources.json) at runtime.
# The fed source files (PDFs) are needed only by 03_COMPANION_KNOWLEDGE.R to feed/rebuild, so keep them
# out of the image; use a volume or LIPIDOMIC_KB_DIR to rebuild inside a container.
knowledge_base/library/sources/

